{"headword":"צְעָקָה","parent_lexicon":"BDB Dictionary","content":{"senses":[{"definition":"<strong>n.f. cry, outcry (</strong>older form of <span dir=\"rtl\">זְעָקָה</span><strong>)</strong>;—abs. <span dir=\"rtl\">צ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 27:34\" href=\"/Genesis.27.34\">Gn 27:34</a> +; cstr. <span dir=\"rtl\">צַעֲקַת</span> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 3:9\" href=\"/Exodus.3.9\">Ex 3:9</a> +; sf. <span dir=\"rtl\">צַעֲקָתוֹ</span> <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 9:16\" href=\"/I_Samuel.9.16\">1 S 9:16</a> +, etc.;—"},{"senses":[{"definition":"<em>outcry</em> against (Sodom) <a data-ref=\"Genesis 18:21\" href=\"/Genesis.18.21\">Gn 18:21</a>; <a data-ref=\"Genesis 19:13\" href=\"/Genesis.19.13\">19:13</a> (both J)."}],"num":"1."},{"senses":[{"definition":"<em>cry of distress</em>, especially as <em>heard</em> by <span dir=\"rtl\">י׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 3:7\" href=\"/Exodus.3.7\">Ex 3:7</a> (J), <a data-ref=\"Exodus 22:22\" href=\"/Exodus.22.22\">22:22</a> (E), cf. <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 5:7\" href=\"/Isaiah.5.7\">Is 5:7</a>; <a data-ref=\"Job 27:9\" href=\"/Job.27.9\">Jb 27:9</a>; <a data-ref=\"Job 34:28\" href=\"/Job.34.28\">34:28</a> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 9:13\" href=\"/Psalms.9.13\">ψ 9:13</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">צ׳ בָּאָה אֵלַי</span> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 3:9\" href=\"/Exodus.3.9\">Ex 3:9</a> (E), <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 9:16\" href=\"/I_Samuel.9.16\">1 S 9:16</a>, cf. <a data-ref=\"Job 34:28\" href=\"/Job.34.28\">Jb 34:28</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">צ׳ גְּדֹלָה</span> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 11:6\" href=\"/Exodus.11.6\">Ex 11:6</a>; <a data-ref=\"Exodus 12:30\" href=\"/Exodus.12.30\">12:30</a> (both J), <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 5:1\" href=\"/Nehemiah.5.1\">Ne 5:1</a>; as acc. cogn. <a data-ref=\"Genesis 27:34\" href=\"/Genesis.27.34\">Gn 27:34</a> (J); <span dir=\"rtl\">קוֹל צ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 4:14\" href=\"/I_Samuel.4.14\">1 S 4:14</a>; <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 25:36\" href=\"/Jeremiah.25.36\">Je 25:36</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">יְלָלָה</span>), <a data-ref=\"Zephaniah 1:10\" href=\"/Zephaniah.1.10\">Zp 1:10</a> (‖ id., + <span dir=\"rtl\">שֶׁבֶר גדול</span>), <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 48:3\" href=\"/Jeremiah.48.3\">Je 48:3</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">שֹׁד וָשֶׁבֶר גדול</span>), cf. <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 49:21\" href=\"/Jeremiah.49.21\">49:21</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">צעֲקַת שֶׁבֶר</span> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 48:5\" href=\"/Jeremiah.48.5\">48:5</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">בְּכִי</span>)."}],"num":"2."}]},"rid":"BDB08498","strong_numbers":["6818"],"next_hw":"צָעַר","prev_hw":"צָעַק","all_cited":true,"quotes":[],"GK":["7591"],"TWOT":["1947a"],"parent_lexicon_details":{"name":"BDB Dictionary","language":"heb.biblical","to_language":"eng","text_categories":[],"source":"BDB Dictionary","attribution":"F. Brown, S. Driver & C. Briggs","index_title":"BDB","version_title":"A Hebrew and English lexicon of the Old Testament, by Francis Brown. With the co-operation of S. R. Driver and Charles A. Briggs. Oxford, 1906","version_lang":"en","should_autocomplete":true}}